   "id": "seg-01",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "I try to push to the main branch, but it is protected. Before the meeting, I review the encryption one more time. The team talks about the encrypted connection at the standup. When I use the protected branch, I ask Maria for advice. I compare the branch protection rule with my notes. Priya starts with \"Call an ambulance.\" and I continue with \"I need help immediately.\" I write down what I learned today.",
   "tts": "I try to push to the main branch, but it is protected. Before the meeting, I review the encryption one more time. The team talks about the encrypted connection at the standup. When I use the protected branch, I ask Maria for advice. I compare the branch protection rule with my notes. Priya starts with \"Call an ambulance.\" and I continue with \"I need help immediately.\" I write down what I learned today.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-01.mp3",
   "zh": "我想直接推送到主分支，但它是受保护的。开会前，我又复习了一遍加密。团队在站会上讨论了加密连接。使用受保护分支时，我向 Maria 请教。我把分支保护规则和我的笔记做了比较。Priya先说了\"叫救护车。\"我接着说：\"我立刻需要帮助。\"我记下了今天学到的东西。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "encryption",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "加密，把数据转换成未经授权无法读取的形式"
    },
    {
     "w": "encrypted connection",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "加密连接，传输内容受到保护的网络连接"
    },
    {
     "w": "Call an ambulance.",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "叫救护车。"
    },
    {
     "w": "I need help immediately.",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "我立刻需要帮助。"
    },
    {
     "w": "protected branch",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "受保护分支，限制直接修改的重要分支"
    },
    {
     "w": "branch protection rule",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "分支保护规则，规定合并前必须满足的条件"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "seg-02",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "In the afternoon, there is a fire drill. Everyone is safe. When we meet, Leo says, \"Where is the nearest hospital?\" I reply, \"I've lost my phone.\" When I use the privacy setting, I ask Maria for advice. I compare the data backup with my notes. Priya and I look for a detail in the required approval. It takes me ten minutes to restrict pushes. With the team's help, the problem becomes smaller.",
   "tts": "In the afternoon, there is a fire drill. Everyone is safe. When we meet, Leo says, \"Where is the nearest hospital?\" I reply, \"I've lost my phone.\" When I use the privacy setting, I ask Maria for advice. I compare the data backup with my notes. Priya and I look for a detail in the required approval. It takes me ten minutes to restrict pushes. With the team's help, the problem becomes smaller.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-02.mp3",
   "zh": "下午，大楼有消防演习。所有人都安全。见面时，Leo说：\"最近的医院在哪里？\"我回答：\"我的手机丢了。\"使用隐私设置时，我向 Maria 请教。我把数据备份和我的笔记做了比较。Priya 和我在必需批准里找一个细节。我花了十分钟限制推送。在团队的帮助下，问题变小了。",
   "hard": [
    {
