     "def": "限制推送，只允许特定人员直接推送"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "seg-03",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Before I leave, I review what I did today. Before the meeting, I review the signed commit one more time. The team talks about the security policy at the standup. Before I restore data, I read the note. I compare the recovery key with my notes. Priya starts with \"Please contact the police.\" and I continue with \"Is everyone safe?\" Now I understand the rule: reviews protect the main branch.",
   "tts": "Before I leave, I review what I did today. Before the meeting, I review the signed commit one more time. The team talks about the security policy at the standup. Before I restore data, I read the note. I compare the recovery key with my notes. Priya starts with \"Please contact the police.\" and I continue with \"Is everyone safe?\" Now I understand the rule: reviews protect the main branch.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-03.mp3",
   "zh": "离开前，我回顾了今天做的事。开会前，我又复习了一遍签名提交。团队在站会上讨论了安全政策。在恢复数据之前，我先看了说明。我把恢复密钥和我的笔记做了比较。Priya先说了\"请联系警察。\"我接着说：\"所有人都安全吗？\"现在我理解了规则：评审保护主分支。",
   "hard": [
